<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <span class="footer-logo">생터</span>
        <span class="footer-logo-divider">|</span>
        <span class="footer-logo-sub">LETTERS 2026</span>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-socials">
        <a href="https://info.ahaja.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">생터홈페이지</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ahaja_official" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@%EC%83%9D%ED%84%B0%EC%84%B1%EA%B2%BD%EC%82%AC%EC%97%AD%EC%9B%90" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-divider"></div>
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p class="footer-info">
        생터성경사역원 미디어팀
        <span class="footer-sep">|</span>
        043-236-3927 (내선 2)<br />
        <span class="footer-sep">|</span>
        충북 청주시 흥덕구 오송읍 연제1길25
      </p>
      <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Life Place Bible Ministries. All Rights Reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-inner {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 80px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .footer-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .footer-logo {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
  }

  .footer-logo-divider {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .footer-logo-sub {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .footer-socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .footer-socials a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65) !important;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) !important;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }

  .footer-socials a:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    color: #ff9776 !important;
  }

  .footer-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .footer-info br {
    display: none;
  }

  .footer-info {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45) !important;
  }

  .footer-sep {
    margin: 0 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .footer-copy {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) !important;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .footer-inner {
      padding: 40px 1.5rem;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .footer-top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .footer-socials {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-info br {
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
